bor Department  those relationships with workers and  poising our companies the businesses to  come back but also to have those workers  still tied to them and keeping those  strong relationships is really going to  be very important to getting the Comedie  economy going again alright it is great  to have the Secretary of Labor from the  United States mr. Scalia with us today  so thank you very much thank you thank  you
 

